        "mode": "Metro",
        "has": true,
        "best": true,
        "text": "12+ lines, single ride about ¥5. Buy a Changantong card or scan WeChat/Alipay. Fast and cheap for the station and main sights."
      },
      {
        "mode": "Bus",
        "has": true,
        "text": "¥1–2 flat fare. Line 610 (tourist 8) links the station, Bell Tower and pagodas."
      },
      {
        "mode": "Taxi / ride apps",
        "has": true,
        "text": "Taxis are cheap but hard to hail at rush hour and shift change; watch the meter. DiDi, WeChat and Alipay ride-hailing work widely."
      },
      {
        "mode": "Rental car",
        "has": true,
        "text": "Not advised for visitors. Traffic and parking are tough."
      },
      {
        "mode": "Walking",
        "has": true,
        "best": true,
        "text": "Best inside the city walls. Shared bikes are handy for the wall and short hops."
      }
